# Visit the project board
@scenario office_lesson_17
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg office]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip desk present]
pip: Our story can hand off to a JES scene for a visual interlude.
pip: Inspect scripts/scenes/office_board.jes and preview it in the JES editor. Change the board panel color.
> Visit the board -> visit
> Try the checkpoint -> check
@label visit
[jes push scripts/scenes/office_board.jes label check]
@label check
pip: Where would you edit a JES panel?
> In the .jes scene that owns it. -> correct
> In the speaker declaration. -> retry
@label retry
[show pip desk curious]
pip: VNS controls story flow. JES owns the entities in its scene. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip desk cheer]
pip: VNS controls story flow. JES owns the entities in its scene.
> Finish this lesson -> return_hub
> Try the lesson again -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_17]
[flag tutorial_done_17]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_4]
